Lists everything attached right now: simulators, phones, emulators, AVDs, the desktop, and browsers with installed drivers

Usage: leptoskit device list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json     Print the machine-readable inventory instead of a table
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
